    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just got another letter saying my application was denied because of a \"clerical error\" that they won't fix. it's the fourth time this month. it feels like i dont even exist to them. like im just a glitch in some machine that's designed to just crush people. i'm so tired of fighting for a life that the world clearly doesnt want me to have.",
